  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879518",
      "title": "Disabling CSS Transitions",
      "lectureOrder": 205,
      "videoOrder": 180,
      "sourceHash": "d25bd7b17c7e00db6339ac846017b30db7f5271a8d9d430fc78424a9edb501df",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.85,
          "en": "Now, we saw JavaScript based animations in action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.85,
          "end": 7.8,
          "en": "with help of these special events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.8,
          "end": 9.68,
          "en": "and I just want to emphasize again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.68,
          "end": 12.43,
          "en": "that these events are always emitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.43,
          "end": 14.88,
          "en": "no matter if you control your animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.88,
          "end": 16.63,
          "en": "with JavaScript or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.63,
          "end": 19.75,
          "en": "If you control it with CSS, as we did before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.75,
          "end": 21.67,
          "en": "those events are also emitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.67,
          "end": 23.883,
          "en": "so that you can run any code you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.96,
          "end": 27.52,
          "en": "But you can also leverage those events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.52,
          "end": 29.19,
          "en": "as you saw in the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.19,
          "end": 32.53,
          "en": "to control the entire animation through JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.53,
          "end": 35.58,
          "en": "either through your own JavaScript code, as we did it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.58,
          "end": 37.79,
          "en": "or by using another third party,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.79,
          "end": 40.373,
          "en": "JavaScript animation library, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.41,
          "end": 44.61,
          "en": "Now, if you control your entire animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.61,
          "end": 45.99,
          "en": "through JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.99,
          "end": 48.7,
          "en": "as we're doing it here on this paragraph now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.7,
          "end": 52.57,
          "en": "you can add another property on this transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.57,
          "end": 55.06,
          "en": "Instead of setting a name, which we don't need now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.06,
          "end": 58.42,
          "en": "you can add the CSS prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.42,
          "end": 61.493,
          "en": "and bind it to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.89,
          "end": 64.51,
          "en": "Now, what does this do?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.51,
          "end": 67.83,
          "en": "This tells vue that this transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.83,
          "end": 69.63,
          "en": "controlled by this transition component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.63,
          "end": 74.63,
          "en": "on this paragraph will not use CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.78,
          "end": 77.03,
          "en": "It will not use a CSS transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.03,
          "end": 80.66,
          "en": "or a CSS animation defined in CSS code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.66,
          "end": 83.33,
          "en": "Instead, the entire transition will be controlled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.33,
          "end": 84.68299999999999,
          "en": "through JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.07,
          "end": 89.11,
          "en": "And why is this a helpful piece of information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.11,
          "end": 90.78,
          "en": "we can pass to you?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.78,
          "end": 94.61,
          "en": "It's technically not required, as you saw it worked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.61,
          "end": 96.68,
          "en": "But now by passing this prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.68,
          "end": 101.11,
          "en": "we tell vue that it doesn't even need to search",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.11,
          "end": 104.02000000000001,
          "en": "for the respective CSS classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.02000000000001,
          "end": 106.78999999999999,
          "en": "in our CSS code for this transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.78999999999999,
          "end": 110.64,
          "en": "It doesn't even need to try to read the duration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.64,
          "end": 113.84,
          "en": "from our CSS code, because it won't find it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.84,
          "end": 115.973,
          "en": "because we're not using CSS code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 117.28999999999999,
          "end": 121.46,
          "en": "Therefore, it skips this CSS analysis step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.46,
          "end": 125.25,
          "en": "it skips searching for the respect of CSS classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.25,
          "end": 128.13,
          "en": "and the duration of this animation in CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.13,
          "end": 131.1,
          "en": "And that simply improves performance a little bit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.1,
          "end": 134.64,
          "en": "because it doesn't need to do this unnecessary step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.64,
          "end": 137.68,
          "en": "Hence, you should of course only add CSS false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 137.68,
          "end": 141.493,
          "en": "if you really don't use CSS code for this transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.47,
          "end": 143.303,
          "en": "And for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.303,
          "end": 145.983,
          "en": "on the other transition user that we have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.89,
          "end": 149.05,
          "en": "like on these two alternative buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.05,
          "end": 152.51,
          "en": "we absolutely must not set CSS to false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.51,
          "end": 154.81,
          "en": "because there we are relying on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.81,
          "end": 157.183,
          "en": "CSS transitions and animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.27,
          "end": 159.46,
          "en": "But if you don't do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 159.46,
          "end": 163.21,
          "en": "if you just control your animation through JavaScript only,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.21,
          "end": 167.753,
          "en": "then you can set CSS to false, to optimize performance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 169.32999999999998,
          "end": 171.62,
          "en": "With that, we reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.62,
          "end": 173.74,
          "en": "This still works as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.74,
          "end": 176.78,
          "en": "but now even a bit more performant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.78,
          "end": 178.77,
          "en": "Will not notice the difference here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.77,
          "end": 181.16,
          "en": "but it is there, and tiny things like that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.16,
          "end": 183.153,
          "en": "can make your app faster in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
